1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,119
The volumetric route, also called titrimetric analysis, measures a volume instead.

2
00:00:06,119 --> 00:00:14,934
A solution of accurately known concentration runs from a burette into the unknown, until the reaction is exactly complete.

3
00:00:14,934 --> 00:00:18,203
The volume used tells you how much of the unknown was there.

